  "description": "Hwan, a college student, is introduced to a part time job of babysitting.\nTo his surprise, Nabi, his employer, makes a move on him on his first night of work.\nHe is even more surprised when Nabi seems to casually brush off this encounter and signs him on for work. \n\nSo begins a peculiar working environment, as Hwan starts to care for Yoojoo, Nabi's son, and things get more personal and complicated between Hwan and Nabi \n\n(Source: Pocket Comics) \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes a prologue.*",
